# Environment Variables

## Daily theme generator
# Required for `npm run generate-theme` / the daily-theme GitHub Action
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# Optional. TypeSafe System One (Jev) taste judge for daily theme ranking.
# Early access: https://typesafe.ai — POST https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone
# TYPESAFE_API_KEY=
# TYPESAFE_MODEL=jev-latest
# DAILY_THEME_SKIP_JEV=1
